"{    \"translations\": [        {            \"english_version\": \"The mayor of Qusra says Israeli troops have been telling families to leave their houses and are using some houses as barracks.\",            \"english_title\": \"Israeli Troops in Qusra\",            \"translated_version\": \"El alcalde de Qusra dice que los soldados israel\u00edes han estado diciendo a las familias que salgan de sus casas y est\u00e1n usando algunas casas como cuarteles.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Soldados israel\u00edes en Qusra\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"In an interview with the BBC, Dmitry Muratov says the leader of Russia can only destroy Ukraine, not conquer it, as the war is now in its fifth year.\",            \"english_title\": \"Russia and Ukraine War\",            \"translated_version\": \"En una entrevista con la BBC, Dmitry Muratov dice que el l\u00edder de Rusia solo puede destruir Ucrania, no conquistarla, ya que la guerra est\u00e1 ahora en su quinto a\u00f1o.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Guerra entre Rusia y Ucrania\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"The outbreak, declared on 15 May, has caused more than 2,000 deaths, with thousands more reported cases.\",            \"english_title\": \"Disease Outbreak\",            \"translated_version\": \"El brote, declarado el 15 de mayo, ha causado m\u00e1s de 2,000 muertes, con miles de casos m\u00e1s reportados.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Brote de enfermedad\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"There are reports of food shortages and broken plumbing on the USS Abraham Lincoln, which has been deployed since November.\",            \"english_title\": \"Problems on USS Abraham Lincoln\",            \"translated_version\": \"Hay informes de escasez de comida y tuber\u00edas rotas en el USS Abraham Lincoln, que ha estado desplegado desde noviembre.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Problemas en el USS Abraham Lincoln\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"The UK government says it is disrupting and deterring shadow fleet vessels according to the law.\",            \"english_title\": \"UK Acts Against Shadow Fleet\",            \"translated_version\": \"El gobierno del Reino Unido dice que est\u00e1 interrumpiendo y disuadiendo a los barcos de la flota sombra seg\u00fan la ley.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Reino Unido act\u00faa contra flota sombra\"        }    ]}"